      "effect_text": {
        "en": {
          "plain": "[Cn/Turn] [Counter] Choose one of the following.\n• If you have a monster with \"Yamigedo\" in its name or a [Duo] on your field, for this turn, you cannot take damage from your opponent's card effects.\n• For this turn, the next time your opponent would take damage from your cards' \"Thunder Mine\", for each of your face up BuddyGift, that damage cannot be reduced nor avoided.\n(For example, if you have one face up BuddyGift, your opponent will take one unavoidable damage from \"Thunder Mine\"!)",
